\title{Vector fields and trajectories}
\date{2026-11-25}

\p{The pair at one instant is a point. The Morris–Lecar equations
assign a velocity to that point. A voltage recording keeps one
coordinate of the moving point.}

\p{Which curve has, at every time, the velocity those equations assign?}

